  "bio": "Nick Baxter is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Austin, Texas, who specializes in the 'newschool' style. He is incredibly popular and highly sought after, boasting a following of nearly 63,000 on Instagram. His dedication to fine art and education shines through in each meticulously drawn tattoo, making him stand out in the industry. His neat and organized workspace at Art Realm Tattoo further emphasizes his commitment to professionalism and cleanliness.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Austin, Texas, United States\n\nTattoos \\ Fine Art \\ Education\nArt Realm Tattoo \\ Austin TX\nTattoo booking, painting workshops, available art & merch at",
